---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site, whatsappLink } from '../data/site';
// TODO(client): have this reviewed by your legal advisor and add your email address.
---

<Legal
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Tradot Academy handles personal information shared through this website, WhatsApp and phone."
  updated="10 October 2026"
>
  <p>
    This policy explains what information Tradot Academy ("we", "us") collects when you use this website or contact
    us, and how we use it. We are based in {site.location}, India.
  </p>

  <h2>What this website collects</h2>
  <p>
    This website does not have user accounts, does not take payments and does not store the details you type into
    the enquiry form. When you submit the form, your browser opens WhatsApp with your message filled in. Nothing is
    sent to us until you choose to send that message in WhatsApp.
  </p>
  <p>We do not use advertising or analytics cookies on this website.</p>

  <h2>Information you share with us</h2>
  <p>When you contact us by WhatsApp or phone, we receive the details you choose to share, such as:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>your name and phone number</li>
    <li>your preferred batch (online or offline)</li>
    <li>any message or questions you send</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We use this only to reply to your enquiry, share batch details, and manage your enrolment if you join. We do not
    sell or rent your information to anyone.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party services</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>WhatsApp</strong> (Meta) handles messages you send us. Its own privacy policy applies to those messages.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Google Maps</strong> is embedded on the contact page. Google may set cookies or collect usage data when
      the map loads.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Market news links</strong> on the Market News page lead to Moneycontrol and Investing.com, which have
      their own privacy policies.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Cloudflare</strong> hosts this website and may process basic technical data (such as IP address) to
      deliver and protect it.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How long we keep information</h2>
  <p>
    We keep enquiry and student details only as long as needed to respond to you, run the program and meet any legal
    requirements. You can ask us to delete your details at any time.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask us what information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it. Contact us on
    WhatsApp at <a href={whatsappLink()} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{site.phoneDisplay}</a> or call
    <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows when it last changed.</p>
</Legal>
